      data:
        m_Value: those who worshiped them were far too gone to realise. We are not
          built upon pagan fantasies. We are different. Which is why I have hope
          in a time where we are faced with such uncertain tragedy. Our own great
          Maker stood before all odds, a human man facing so called Gods, yet they
          were nothing and this will be the same.\n\n   I would be a hypocrite however
          to not admit to the fear that pulsed through my body when I saw it occur
          the first time. I was there when the first of the afflicted fell. A man
          collapsed before the Beacon,
