    - rid: 8910043418339311949
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: the flesh of his arms ripped like a chasm as clusters of hands wriggled
          out, fingers twitching and pulsing like maggots. He wailed in agony as
          the hands continued to crawl out from beneath his skin, we could hear the
          scratching and tearing as each of them surfaced, pushing through their
          torn opening like a fetus. He was alive by the end, alive through it all.\n\n  
          Something silent strung through the air, tying itself around our necks
          like a noose, a silent fear shared between us. We prided ourselves in knowledge,
          the unknown was beneath us, and yet we had no
