    - rid: 8910043418339311986
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: The High Avowed himself conducted the initial autopsy by order of
          the Maker. Heart failure was my own predicted cause of death and I seem
          to be correct, his body did not have enough blood to maintain dozens of
          newly birthed limbs. There seems to be no current method of entirely halting
          this rapid growth, The High Avowed did discuss that it slowed down significantly
          after the initial frenzy, but it is the aftermath that kills. We are delicate
          creations, our composition made to be efficient, the body can only handle
          so many foreign anomalies.
