    - rid: 8910043418339312007
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.Int32, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: 12
    - rid: 8910043418339312008
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "this has not been consistent with other afflicted individuals.
          As of now, there has been no limit to what organs or limbs can flare and
          spread, internal or external.\\n\\n   A child\u2019s hearts spread up her
          windpipe and she started to suffocate on them. We operated on her and took
          what we could but we were watching her body make more hearts as we were
          taking each one out. She died of shock.Our current hypothesis is that this
          is an airborne pathogen due to how quickly it is able to spread in such
          a short span of time."
    - rid: 8910043418339312009
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
