        m_Value: 18
    - rid: 8910043418339312176
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "but even after surgically removing new growth it returns after
          some time.\\n\\n  What frightens me is how\u2026 Salt is the most controlled
          and monitored substance both inside and outside the Circles. Entire divisions
          of Keepers work to keep it that way. If salt was smuggled into the Circles
          somehow we would have known. We are presenting these findings to the Maker
          soon, the Veil will shield us, it will guide our minds to find the root
          of this, for we are its most faithful."
    - rid: 8910043418339312177
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
