        m_Value: 19
    - rid: 8910043418339312187
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: The Maker stated his suspicions, there are correlations between
          our current scourge and the scourge that occurred one hundred years prior
          during the Makers' time. I requested that we have access to the Library,
          it chronicles the time period before the Veil, but the Maker instructed
          otherwise.\n\n  He entrusted us with a secret, our efforts have elevated
          us in the Veils standing. This scourge was considered a blessing prior
          to the Veils creation. It was manufactured as a method to please their
          Gods, the abundance of organs and limbs were used as offerings.
    - rid: 8910043418339312188
